SELECT 'agent-inactivity-audit', 'Case: Agent Inactivity Audit', 'case_study', 'Hard', 'Fintech',
       'Subqueries', ARRAY['anti-join','date']::text[], '**Scenario.** Distribution audits agent points every quarter; an agent with no successful transaction after **8 June 2026** is flagged dormant.

Return `agent_id` and `shop_name` of dormant agents, with their last successful activity date (`last_active`, NULL if never active), oldest activity first (NULLs first).',
